<title>HONG KONG: Recor loses HK$124.79 mln in year.</title>
<headline>Recor loses HK$124.79 mln in year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   33.4 loss   vs 0.4 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  51.70 loss  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    124.79 loss vs 1.59 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     790.93	vs 1,042.74</p>
<p>    Company name		 Recor Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 20-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - A maker of audio products, TVs and telephones.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on deferred development costs written off, provision for diminution in value of associated companies and subsidiaries in liquidation.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs one H.K. cent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
